WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:07.767
Hi, I'm Avery. Welcome to Coulee Power. We sell electricity to homes and small businesses across Alberta.

2
00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:19.133
Here's the problem. Alberta's average pool price fell from a hundred and thirty-four dollars a megawatt hour in 2023, to sixty-three in 2024.

3
00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:24.333
That's a fifty-three percent drop, and we set our twenty twenty-six fixed rates next month.

4
00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:28.600
Your job has three parts. First, show how far the price fell.

5
00:00:28.933 --> 00:00:31.367
Second, explain it with supply and demand.

6
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:36.600
Third, recommend a 2026 fixed rate, with a buffer you can defend.

7
00:00:37.333 --> 00:00:43.600
The A-E-S-O data is in your resources. I want one slide. Jenna is your coach if you get stuck.
